===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In accordance with [[reason]].
#: {{ux|en|They were able handle their disagreements '''reasonably'''.}}
# [[fairly|Fairly]]; [[satisfactorily]]; not [[extremely]].
#: {{ux|en|The shoes were '''reasonably''' priced.}}
# [[quite|Quite]]; [[fairly]]; [[satisfactorily]].
#: {{ux|en|That car goes '''reasonably''' fast.}}

